---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import Section from "../components/Section.astro";
import CtaButton from "../components/CtaButton.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Corporate Solutions"
  description="Custom AI consulting and training engagements designed to transform how your organization works with AI."
>
  <Section title="Corporate Solutions" image="/assets/services/corporate-solutions.jpg">
    <p>Custom AI training and consulting designed to transform how your organization works with AI.</p>
    <CtaButton href="/contact" variant="primary">Schedule a Discovery Call</CtaButton>
  </Section>

  <Section title="Why Organizations Choose Us">
    <ul>
      <li>Content updates as fast as AI evolves</li>
      <li>Practitioners who deploy AI daily</li>
      <li>Hands-on, applied learning</li>
      <li>Flexible delivery (on-site or virtual)</li>
    </ul>
  </Section>

  <Section title="What We Offer">
    <p>Comprehensive engagements to meet your organization where you are in your AI journey.</p>

    <h3>Custom Workshops</h3>
    <p>Tailored training sessions designed for your specific team, industry, and challenges.</p>
    <ul>
      <li>On-site or virtual delivery</li>
      <li>Teams of 10-100+ participants</li>
      <li>Industry-specific examples and use cases</li>
      <li>Custom program development</li>
      <li>Follow-up resources and support</li>
    </ul>

    <h3>Custom Content</h3>
    <p>Bespoke AI training materials and documentation for your organization.</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Branded training materials</li>
      <li>Internal AI playbooks</li>
      <li>Process documentation</li>
      <li>Video content creation</li>
      <li>Ongoing content updates</li>
    </ul>

    <h3>Consulting</h3>
    <p>Strategic AI guidance to help your organization navigate adoption.</p>
    <ul>
      <li>AI readiness assessment</li>
      <li>Implementation roadmaps</li>
      <li>Tool selection guidance</li>
      <li>Change management support</li>
      <li>ROI measurement frameworks</li>
    </ul>

    <h3>Work With Our Experts</h3>
    <p>Direct access to our team of AI practitioners for your toughest challenges.</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Embedded expert support</li>
      <li>Technical mentorship</li>
      <li>Project-based engagements</li>
      <li>Executive coaching</li>
      <li>Team upskilling programs</li>
    </ul>
  </Section>

  <Section title="How It Works">
    <p>A proven methodology for transforming your team's AI capabilities.</p>
    <ol>
      <li><strong>Discovery Call</strong> — Free 30-minute consultation to understand your team's needs and goals.</li>
      <li><strong>Custom Design</strong> — We design a program tailored to your industry, team size, and objectives.</li>
      <li><strong>Delivery</strong> — Your team learns together, builds together, and levels up together.</li>
      <li><strong>Ongoing Success</strong> — Implementation guides and follow-up resources ensure lasting adoption.</li>
    </ol>
  </Section>

  <Section title="Who We Work With">
    <p>Organizations across industries are transforming with AI.</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Executive Teams</strong> — AI strategy development, vendor evaluation, and leadership alignment on AI initiatives.</li>
      <li><strong>Marketing &amp; Creative</strong> — Content generation, visual AI tools, and creative workflow automation.</li>
      <li><strong>Sales Teams</strong> — Prospecting automation, personalization at scale, and AI-powered CRM workflows.</li>
      <li><strong>Operations</strong> — Process automation, document analysis, and operational efficiency gains.</li>
      <li><strong>Technical Teams</strong> — AI-assisted development, code review automation, and agentic workflows.</li>
    </ul>
  </Section>

  <Section title="Book a Discovery Call">
    <p>Let's discuss how we can help your organization stay ahead of the AI curve.</p>
    <CtaButton href="/contact" variant="primary">Schedule a Discovery Call</CtaButton>
  </Section>
</BaseLayout>
